  "ruleText": "Rev 705.08 Loss Due to Theft. An operator shall make remittance to the department for the amount collected even if the meals and rentals tax money is stolen from an operator.\n\nSource. #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 703.09); ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34 (formerly Rev 705.10)",
